ers.\n\nKian (brunette male) is soft-hearted and easily flustered around Ellena. He fell in love with her at first sight, and is often nervous around her. He has two scars on his face, and is a human. 180 cm. https://sta.sh/226zapjvelwe\n\nEllena (platinum-blonde female) is curious and innocent. She is slowly learning about human emotion, and is similar to the character Chii from the series Chobits! She has elf ears, and iridescent wings like a fairy.  162 cm. https://sta.sh/21i1c6k9f7aw\n\nThe two are travelling companions in a fantasy world! They are future lovers, but it is a slow process. \n\nPlease draw outfit and pose freely!!\n\nMore reference below ⬇️⬇️\nhttps://sta.sh/227pk7bezk2d\n\nThank you for the consideration!!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@moyasu5392/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 879837, "client_id": 1371426, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/667529d8/uploads/origins/9f382968-7cca-4f6c-8013-2b761670b905?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=45b5eb5b85579ef1f41b4f39294d34d8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/667529d8/uploads/origins/9f382968-7cca-4f6c-8013-2b761670b905?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=45b5eb5b85579ef1f41b4f39294d34d8, https://si.imgix.net/667529d8/uploads/origins/9f382968-7cca-4f6c-8013-2b761670b905?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9596a488ecb90d7fbc2dcefbb02b3d96 2x, https://si.imgix.net/667529d8/uploads/origins/9f382968-7cca-4f6c-8013-2b761670b905?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=983c753f74c3ee75f43d0c762b3e1c86 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/667529d8/uploads/origins/9f382968-7cca-4f6c-801